msgid ""
"To escape arrays or objects containing string values, use the "
"`-o`/`--object` option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/jsesc_README.md:374
msgid "To prettify the output in such cases, use the `-p`/`--pretty` option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/jsesc_README.md:384
msgid "For valid JSON output, use the `-j`/`--json` option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/jsesc_README.md:394
msgid ""
"Read a local JSON file, escape any non-ASCII symbols, and save the result"
" to a new file:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/jsesc_README.md:400
msgid "Or do the same with an online JSON file:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/jsesc_README.md:406
msgid "See `jsesc --help` for the full list of options."
